--- Python Virtual Environment ---

Ignore the virtual environment folder completely

venv/

--- Python Bytecode & Cache ---

Ignore compiled Python files

*.pyc

Ignore the Python cache folder

pycache/

--- Temporary Uploads ---

Ignore the folder where you save images from the app

(We don't want to commit user images!)

uploads/

--- macOS System Files ---

Ignore the .DS_Store file

.DS_Store

--- VS Code Settings ---

Ignore the local settings folder

.vscode/